WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.533
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Step-by-Step Thinking Prompts.

2
00:00:05.833 --> 00:00:11.028
Get clearer answers for problems and decisions. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:12.017 --> 00:00:18.854
Step one. Here is a problem. Twelve pens cost six dollars. How much do twenty pens cost?

4
00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:25.233
Step two. Add, think step by step. The AI shows each step of its thinking.

5
00:00:26.217 --> 00:00:32.030
Step three. Check each step yourself. If one step is wrong, tell the AI.

6
00:00:33.017 --> 00:00:39.991
Step four. The final answer is ten dollars. Ask the AI to explain it simply, so you understand.

7
00:00:40.983 --> 00:00:44.843
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:45.143 --> 00:00:48.675
Ask AI a maths problem and say 'think step by step'.

9
00:00:48.975 --> 00:00:50.325
Check each step.

10
00:00:50.625 --> 00:00:54.145
Use it for a decision: study or work first?.

11
00:00:54.445 --> 00:00:55.481
Well done!

